# 📊 Telecommunication Customer Churn Analysis Dashboard

## 📌 Project Overview

Customer churn is one of the biggest challenges faced by telecommunication companies. Acquiring new customers is often more expensive than retaining existing ones, making it essential to understand why customers leave.

This project analyzes customer behavior, service usage, subscription plans, and customer service interactions to identify the factors that influence churn. The analysis was performed using **Microsoft Power BI**, with data cleaning carried out in **Power Query** and business metrics created using **DAX**.

---

## 🎯 Project Objectives

* Analyze customer churn patterns.
* Identify characteristics of customers who are most likely to churn.
* Measure churn across different customer segments.
* Evaluate the impact of service calls and subscription plans on churn.
* Provide actionable recommendations to improve customer retention.

---

