## 📂 Dataset Features

The dataset contains customer information including:

* State
* Account Length
* Area Code
* International Plan
* Voice Mail Plan
* Number of Voice Mail Messages
* Day Usage (Minutes, Calls, Charges)
* Evening Usage (Minutes, Calls, Charges)
* Night Usage (Minutes, Calls, Charges)
* International Usage (Minutes, Calls, Charges)
* Customer Service Calls
* Churn Status (True/False)

